From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 09:23:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 546 unit 3: legacy country is the place of performance only;
 CHANGELOG 541/571; 540 reason string

Legacy TED buyer/winner address regions (TED-CA_CE_NUTS, TED-TENDERER_NUTS, and
TED-NUTS inside an Organization section) are no longer tender places; docs,
openapi and the /v1/sql notes say so with the pre-refold caveat. Adds the
CHANGELOG entries for issues 541 (T02 RES-T02 results) and 571 (ADDRESS_PARTY
owners are not result winners), and the MODIFIED_ADDRESS reason now cites
issue 540's sweep.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
